# Container Click
# Phase play, serverbound (C->S), packet id 0x12 (18)
# Docs: 09 §3.2 row 0x12 and inventory-slot rule; 05c 0x12; 00 §12.4 HashedStack
# Stated inputs: container 0 (player inventory), state id 1, left click (button 0, click type 0 PICKUP) on slot 0
#   holding the starting 64 `greystone` (item 2): changed slots = {slot 0 -> empty}, carried item =
#   64 greystone with no components.

12                                                 # packet id 0x12 (VarInt)
00                                                 # Container id: VarInt 0
01                                                 # State id: VarInt 1
00 00                                              # Slot: Short 0
00                                                 # Button: Byte 0
00                                                 # Click type: VarInt 0 PICKUP
01                                                 # Changed slots: Map count 1
00 00                                              #   changed slot key: Short 0
00                                                 #   changed slot value: HashedStack Present false (empty)
01                                                 # Carried item: HashedStack Present true
02                                                 #   Item: VarInt 2 (greystone)
40                                                 #   Count: VarInt 64
00                                                 #   HashedPatchMap AddedCount: VarInt 0
00                                                 #   HashedPatchMap RemovedCount: VarInt 0
